PROJECT ORIGIN AND ACKNOWLEDGEMENT NOTICE

This informational notice records the origin of the hust_helper project and
does not modify, restrict, or replace the MIT License terms below.


1. The project grew out of years of study, research, and shared dining
   experiences within the author's research group at Huazhong University of
   Science and Technology (HUST).

   本项目源于作者所在课题组在华中科技大学多年的学习、科研与共同吃饭经历。

2. The initial hust_eater guide was developed with reference to the PDF
   “HUSTer 的干饭修养——HUST 求学七年的干饭经验”, written and provided by a
   senior fellow from the HUST School of Mechanical Science and Engineering.
   The source PDF is credited to “许少”.

   hust_eater 的初始资料部分参考了华中科技大学机械学院师兄编写并提供的
   《HUSTer 的干饭修养——HUST 求学七年的干饭经验》PDF，原 PDF 署名为
   “许少 著”。

3. The recommendations, additions, corrections, and taste notes also reflect
   the real dining experiences shared by every friend of the author.

   项目中的推荐、补充、修订与口味判断也凝结了作者每一位朋友的真实饮食
   体验总结。

The software code is licensed under the MIT License below. Source-guide text,
menus, maps, screenshots, photographs, and other third-party content are
subject to the separate notice in DATA_LICENSE.md.

软件代码适用下方 MIT License。原始指南文字、菜单、地图、截图、照片及其他
第三方内容适用 DATA_LICENSE.md 中的单独说明。

